# | Advantech ADAM-4069 — 8-Channel Power Relay Output Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 15)
# | - 8-channel power relay output (higher load ratings than ADAM-4068).
# | - Modbus RTU, FC01 for relay state (coil registers — NOT FC03).
# | - FC01 00017-00024 (coil addr 16-23): Relay Output Value ch0-7 (R/W).
# | - FC03 40211 (addr 210): Module Name 1 (R, 0x40 0x69).
# | - FC03 40212 (addr 211): Module Name 2 (R, 0x00 0x00).
# | - FC03 40213 (addr 212): Firmware Version 1 (R).
# | - FC03 40214 (addr 213): Firmware Version 2 (R).
# | - FC03 40215 (addr 214): Comm Safety Enable (R).
# | - FC03 40216 (addr 215): Comm Safety Flag (R).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
